  "details": "So I tried Dead and Buried yesterday for the first time. I didn't like it too much, but there was this one feature that caught my attention. Every time someone spoke, the audio of the game lowered to like 50% so you could hear them perfectly.\n\nThis would be so nice to have in VRChat. Avatar and world sounds could stay at full volume (if you chose so) and then lower enough to hear people talking when they did. Bonus points if this feature is toggleable.",
